{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:770","content":{"id":770,"title":"聊天管理","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在侧边栏有一个与 AI 模型进行聊天的快捷入口，聊天服务需要在大语言模型中进行配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3990d480-1aab-4dcd-902c-ecdf4d5ad3be.webp","uuid":"25605c8d-258c-44fc-abd7-2c055a94aedb","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3990d480-1aab-4dcd-902c-ecdf4d5ad3be.webp","width":443},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次对话完成后，软件会尝试使用配置的标题总结模型来自动生成标题，如果需要此项服务，也需要在大语言模型中进行配置"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_300444ad-37a1-4b84-815f-84d8df6cda03.webp","uuid":"96a28e67-3bbf-4aa3-98b3-443461f3e6be","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_300444ad-37a1-4b84-815f-84d8df6cda03.webp","width":443},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对话输入框和我们的富文本编辑器输入框一样，支持各种样式的富文本输入，由于回车在富文本编辑器中有单独的作用，因此需要通过 "},{"type":"kbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"mod + Enter"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 快捷键来发送消息。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引用内容"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在输入框中，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来引用一篇内容作为上下文"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_39841291-21f5-4463-a952-f4c912009124.webp","uuid":"72b9a8fd-c4ba-4743-aef4-49f079eb37df","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_39841291-21f5-4463-a952-f4c912009124.webp","width":511},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模型会通过工具载入相关上下文来和你对话。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重新编辑"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以对最新一次的消息进行重新编辑"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_920b76f9-3976-4af2-b6bd-86bfcce344ca.webp","uuid":"acb41c9c-bfac-4731-9277-57d85ca529db","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_920b76f9-3976-4af2-b6bd-86bfcce344ca.webp","width":570.1090200549249},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分支"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以从某次对话开始产生分支，就像一条河流突然分开了多个支流，每个支流都有一部分相同的上下文，但是后续它们的流向各不相同"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4681e346-cf82-443c-bd78-dde00639be61.webp","uuid":"01af4f11-4ada-4ed6-a19c-c7f4fd4659f7","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4681e346-cf82-443c-bd78-dde00639be61.webp","width":571.6014520445975},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自定义输出"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们增强了对于某些格式输出的自定义渲染能力："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HTML"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以让模型输出完整的 HTML，我们会对该格式进行解析渲染，通过 HTML 模型可以输出一些具有交互效果的页面来增强回答效果"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b47b2fb5-7d1a-462a-b4df-8c452bdf